  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 23 (OPERATING TIMES), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 10/P0917, RELATING TO THE  DEMOLITION OF THE SINGLE STOREY BUILDING AT THE REAR OF THE EXISTING SCHOOL BUILDING AND ERECTION OF A NEW TWO STOREY EXTENSION TO THE SIDE OF THE SCHOOL PROVIDING SEVEN NEW CLASSROOMS, CHANGING ROOMS, TOILETS, STORAGE, OFFICE AND CIRCULATION SPACE, WITH THE RELOCATION OF THE EXTERNAL MULTI USE GAMES AREA TO BE PROVIDED AT THE REAR OF THE SITE, AND REFURBISHMENT OF THE EXISTING NURSERY ACCOMMODATION AT THE FRONT OF THE SCHOOL TO PROVIDE A SMALL HALL, TEACHING AND SUPPORT ACCOMMODATION AS PART OF THE EXPANSION OF THE SCHOOL WITH AN INCREASE OF PUPILS FROM THE CURRENT 260 [SINGLE FORM ENTRY] TO A PROPOSED 420 PUPILS [TWO FORM ENTRY] ,  PLUS 26 NURSERY PUPILS. CHANGES RELATE TO USE OF THE SCHOOL'S OUTDOOR PLAY AREAS AND ASSOCIATED EXTERNAL SPACES  OUTSIDE OF STANDARD SCHOOL HOURS. ",
